BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Odd Kid Club Vol.2___ Emphatic Dance Music &lt\;3
DTSTART:20260919T220000
DTEND:20260919T220000
UID:2a9de857e86b67de481913485ece39fd@yohomo.ca
DESCRIPTION:/lineup @KushArora aka Only Now digital polyglot Melonwater ju
 jube orkid @murderclub Odd Kid Club returns for Vol. 2 — a night of emph
 atic dance music for odd kids and kindred spirits\, unfolding inside a sec
 ret Toronto space. From emotion\, through music\, back to you. Same warm e
 nergy\, same open dance floor. Come ready for deep bass\, bold sounds\, an
 d wherever the night takes us. This time\, we welcome Only Now\, the live 
 project of Bay Area producer Kush Arora. Having performed at MUTEK and ear
 ned recognition from The Wire\, FACT\, and XLR8R\, Kush brings his Indian 
 musical roots into a world of heavy bass and raw electronic sound. Live\, 
 the music moves between intimacy and intensity—sometimes meditative\, so
 metimes explosive\, always made to be felt together. No fixed genre\, no n
 eed to fit in. Come curious\, move freely\, and bring your beautiful weird
 ness. See you in the room &lt\;3 ‍
LOCATION:TBA\, Address TO BE ANNOUNCED
URL:https://www.yohomo.ca/event/odd-kid-club-vol-2-emphatic-dance-music-3
X-SOURCE:YOHOMO
END:VEVENT
