DTEND:20260927T120500
UID:8622d2e2674acdf5c5e495e198384ca6@yohomo.ca
DESCRIPTION:The only time you can put baby in a corner... is at drag brunc
 h! Dirty Ugly brings the heat\, the heels\, and the highest level of camp 
 to Gusto 101 for a wild mashup of two iconic cult classics: Coyote Ugly an
 d Dirty Dancing. Get ready for a brunch experience packed with bar-top ene
 rgy\, legendary dance moves\, and a whole lot of “Nobody puts Baby in a 
 corner” attitude. From sultry performances to laugh-out-loud comedy\, th
 is is where messy meets magical and the only thing dirtier than the dancin
 g is the tea being spilled. Hosted by Toronto’s own Sucka Queen\, Dirty 
 Ugly Drag Brunch is a celebration of big personalities\, bigger performanc
 es\, and unapologetic fun. Grab your friends\, enjoy Gusto 101’s iconic 
 food and drinks\, and prepare for a Sunday you won’t forget — because 
 at this brunch\, everyone gets their moment in the spotlight (and maybe ev
 en a lift). 💃🍸 Doors: 11:30AM Show: 12:00PM - 3:00PM Show takes plac
 e in the upstairs patio and requires stairs TICKETS: $15 Early Bird $20 Ge
 neral Admission *Make sure to grab your tickets early\, as seating is limi
 ted! To ensure smooth service during the show\, this event features a $40 
 prix-fixe brunch menu for all guests attending Drag Brunch. Guests will ch
 oose from a selection of first and second course options\, followed by des
 sert. Additional items may also be ordered à la carte. MENU: $40 pp First
  Course (choose one) • Insalata Verde – little gem\, bib lettuce\, esc
 arole\, pickled onions &amp\; red chillies\, parmigiano\, Italian vinaigre
 tte • Cavolo Nero – lacinato kale\, zante currants\, toasted pine nuts
 \, pecorino\, parmigiano\, lemon vinaigrette • Arancini – spicy pomodo
 ro\, mozzarella\, basil crema Second Course (choose one) • Panuozzo – 
 prosciutto cotto\, fior di latte mozzarella\, arugula\, tomato vinaigrette
  • Rigatoni alla Vodka – pomodoro\, vodka\, pancetta\, cream\, parmigi
 ano\, stracciatella\, chili • Strapazzate – free range scrambled eggs\
 , prosciutto cotto\, bomba\, parmigiano\, sourdough Dessert (choose one) 
 • Tiramisù – mascarpone\, espresso\, brandy\, marsala • Cannoli –
  ricotta\, mascarpone\, chocolate\, pistachio\, candied orange • Budino 
 ‍
LOCATION:Gusto\, 101 Portland St
