BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:(b)ODY (p)USSY (m)IND
DTSTART:20261009T220000
DTEND:20261009T220000
UID:2e37060064ec3812bf426063399b40ac@yohomo.ca
DESCRIPTION:(b)ODY (p)USSY (m)IND returns to Geary Warehouse: a free night
  celebrating queer &amp\; trans POC nightlife in Toronto. Angelito Collect
 ive returns to Toronto for the second installment of (b)ODY (p)USSY (m)IND
  at Geary Warehouse. Hailing from New York City\, Angelito Collective is a
  Black trans-led multimedia creative and talent group curating forward-thi
 nking cultural experiences that spotlight emerging and established talent 
 across music\, fashion\, and visual arts. Since the debut of the collectiv
 e’s nightlife series\, (b)ODY (p)USSY (m)IND\, at Dweller this past Febr
 uary\, the series has continued to evolve as a celebratory sonic incubatio
 n—championing some of the most exciting queer and trans POC voices in Ne
 w York City nightlife\, including MS. CARRIE STACKS\, DANIRO\, TYGAPAW\, S
 YDFALLS\, DJ COWRIIE(KEIYAA). For its second Toronto installment\, (b)ODY 
 (p)USSY (m)IND once again brings its energy across the border\, accelerati
 ng the heartbeats of Toronto with Angelito Toronto resident DJs DEMIIGODDE
 S\, SUPREMEWRECK\, and FANNDEMM\, alongside special guest DJs EMRYSLAZULI 
 and AMANIEYES. In partnership with Geary Warehouse\, Angelito is committed
  to making this a free and accessible event. The rising cost of nightlife 
 in Toronto has created increasing barriers to spaces that center the visib
 ility\, amplification\, and celebration of queer and trans POC artists wit
 hin the city’s music scene. At its core\, (b)ODY (p)USSY (m)IND is about
  more than the dance floor. It is about creating the conditions for possib
 ility—making room for new connections\, new collaborations\, and new vis
 ions for what nightlife and community can be. This night is not only a cel
 ebration of the emerging pulse of Toronto’s underground scene\, but an i
 nvitation to participate in something larger: ambitious visions of culture
 \, community\, connection\, and possibility. ‍
LOCATION:Geary Avenue Warehouse Project\, 209 Geary Avenue
URL:https://www.yohomo.ca/event/b-ody-p-ussy-m-ind
X-SOURCE:YOHOMO
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:body2body ft. SHERELLE
DTSTART:20261009T220000
DTEND:20261009T220000
UID:f791f3e6512390f3d0396240ad6cdeb1@yohomo.ca
DESCRIPTION:she&#x27\;s back\, with a vengeance! dark\, lovely &amp\; ever
 lasting -- we celebrate the eclectic sonic realm of jungle\, DNB + more. S
 HERELLE is the champion of high speed dance music who has led a new genera
 tion of club kids to tempos of 160bpm and beyond. Named one of Mixmag’s 
 Top 25 Producers Who Defined the Year\, nominated for the MOBO Awards’ B
 est Electronic Act and winner of DJ Mag’s Best of British 2025: Breakthr
 ough Producer\, SHERELLE entered a new era of artistry with the release of
  her debut album WITH A VENGEANCE (WAV). She has since continued to build 
 out the WAV universe with WAV RELOADED\, a selection of choice cuts rework
 ed with vocals from Kibo\, Killa P and Logan. Behind the scenes\, SHERELLE
 ’s BEAUTIFUL project continues to empower Black and LGBTQI artists\, wit
 h hundreds of musicians having had access to the BEAUTIFUL studio in Londo
 n\, underpinning SHERELLE’s ongoing commitment to ownership\, authorship
  and grassroots community in the music industry [Written by Seb Wheeler]. 
 With us are local giants --- Marcus Visionary who has been at the forefron
 t of the Jungle DNB scene in Toronto Canada before its very inception. He&
 #x27\;s often referred to as Canada&#x27\;s #1 DNB &amp\; Jungle export as
  well as being an ambassador for the ever evolving Jungle DNB sound worldw
 ide. Marcus is one of the few artists out of North America who has built a
  strong foundation in the U.K &amp\; Europe as well as in the U.S and all 
 over Canada.. The journey started in 2004 when he was personally signed to
  the legendary Digital Soundboy family by Shy FX himself. Marcus joined th
 e elite all star lineup alongside the likes of Benny Page\, Breakage\, Mar
 k System\, Stamina MC &amp\; B Traits. Currently Marcus is focused on runn
 ing his many labels alongside his longtime business partner DJ LUSH.† Th
 ey have been co running Inner City Dance\, Stereo One Music\, Inner City D
 ubs all distributed worldwide via Cygnus music. further support from guest
  jungliest from Montreal\, JAMVVIS + selectors CHINELO &amp\; RAF REZA (vi
 nyl set) the dancefloor opens soon \; prepare your crew for pure XTC Locat
 ion will be posted on RA &amp\; social media the week of the event. small 
 batch of $10 tickets are always available \; thank you for the continuous 
 support &lt\;3 ‍ ‍
LOCATION:TBA\, Address TO BE ANNOUNCED
URL:https://www.yohomo.ca/event/body2body-ft-sherelle
X-SOURCE:YOHOMO
END:VEVENT
