BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Harder Toronto
DTSTART:20261010T220000
DTEND:20261010T220000
UID:1ccb0f479affcf4f8cb6280845777744@yohomo.ca
DESCRIPTION:HARDER(finally) returns to Toronto after almost 2 years at our
  new home: COMPLEX19 If you’ve never been to HARDER\, the party is a hig
 h-energy\, sex-positive night filled with great House music and an inclusi
 ve\, expressive\, liberation-focused environment for attendees!!!! The lin
 eup: Masha Mar is a Serbian-born\, Los Angeles-based DJ\, music producer\,
  and event promoter known for her versatile electronic sets that blend cos
 mic disco\, tribal rhythms\, deep house\, and left-field tracks. Over the 
 years\, she has built a prominent reputation in the underground dance musi
 c scene through her performances\, radio presence\, and community-building
  initiatives She has played Panorama Bar\, Boiler Room\, Sheila NYC\, Dig 
 Deeper LA\, and twice for HARDER. It’s Marsha Mar Toronto debut !!!! Ric
 cardo Tavarez (also known as Ricardo Tavares) is a Rio de Janeiro-born\, B
 rooklyn-based DJ and event organizer who has been a prominent fixture in u
 nderground queer nightlife for nearly three decades. Heavily influenced by
  the global clubbing cultures of institutions like Sound Factory in New Yo
 rk and Berghain in Berlin\, his sets feature an eclectic mix of house\, el
 ectroclash\, old-school disco\, and techno. He is the founder of the parti
 es HARDER and ConTEAnental in NYC Aeryn Pfaff is a versatile\, Toronto-bas
 ed DJ\, event promoter\, and freelance journalist who has spent over a dec
 ade anchoring the city’s queer electronic music scene. Tickets are avail
 able now !! Link in my bio Artwork @comicblues ‍
LOCATION:Complex19\, 19 Toronto St
URL:https://www.yohomo.ca/event/harder-toronto
X-SOURCE:YOHOMO
END:VEVENT
